# Koleksi REST — WhatsApp (penautan nomor)
#
# Salin session.access_token dari respons login (auth.http) ke @token.
# Urutan alur normal: status -> link/request -> (OTP tiba di WhatsApp) -> link/verify
# -> preferences -> DELETE link. Ganti nomor di bawah dengan nomor WhatsApp Anda sendiri
# (+62...). Bot hanya mengirim OTP ke nomor yang diminta, maksimal 3 kali per nomor per hari.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = GANTI_DENGAN_ACCESS_TOKEN_DARI_LOGIN

### ============================================================
### GET /whatsapp/status
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 200 {status: unlinked | pending | verified, masked_phone, expires_at, ..., preferences}
GET {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error 401: tanpa token
GET {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/status

### ============================================================
### POST /whatsapp/link/request
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 200 {status: "pending", expires_at, masked_phone}
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+628123456789"
}

### Error 400: tanpa kode negara
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "08123456789"
}

### Error 400: kode negara bukan +62
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+14155550123"
}

### Error 400: nomor terlalu pendek, mengandung huruf
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+62abc"
}

### Error 409 CONFLICT: nomor sudah terverifikasi di akun lain
### (tautkan nomor yang sama dari pengguna kedua setelah pengguna pertama memverifikasinya)
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+628123456789"
}

### Error 429 RATE_LIMITED: kirim request yang sama lebih dari 3 kali dalam sehari
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+628123456789"
}

### Error 503 SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE: sesi bot terputus (matikan OpenWA lalu kirim request ini)
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+628123456789"
}

### ============================================================
### POST /whatsapp/link/verify
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 200 {status: "verified", phone, verified_at}. Isi code dengan OTP dari WhatsApp.
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "483920"
}

### Error 400: kode salah, details[].attempts_left menunjukkan sisa percobaan (maksimal 5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "000000"
}

### Error 400: kode bukan 6 digit
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "48392"
}

### Error 400: kode berisi huruf
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "abcdef"
}

### ============================================================
### POST /whatsapp/link/resend
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 200 {status: "pending", expires_at, masked_phone}. Tanpa body.
# Error 404 bila tidak ada permintaan yang menunggu; 429 bila kurang dari 60 detik sejak kiriman terakhir.
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error 401: tanpa token
POST {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link/resend

### ============================================================
### PATCH /whatsapp/preferences
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 200 WhatsappStatus (hanya untuk tautan verified)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "daily_summary_enabled": true,
  "budget_alert_enabled": false
}

### Error 400: body kosong (minimal satu field)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Error 400: nilai bukan boolean
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "daily_summary_enabled": "ya"
}

### Error 404: tautan belum terverifikasi
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "daily_summary_enabled": true
}

### ============================================================
### DELETE /whatsapp/link
### ============================================================

# Sukses: 204 (soft: status menjadi disabled, riwayat pesan tetap ada)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error 404: tidak ada tautan aktif (jalankan dua kali)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Error 401: tanpa token
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/whatsapp/link
